---
description: >-
  Ticket links: the ticketBaseUrl holds #TICKET# twice and only the first
  is replaced. A ticket with a dollar sign links with the dollar literal,
  and a card with no ticket has no link.
config:
  kanban:
    ticketBaseUrl: 'https://example.com/browse/#TICKET#?from=#TICKET#'
---
kanban
  todo[Todo]
    a[Linked]@{ ticket: MC-1 }
    b[Dollar in the ticket]@{ ticket: 'a$&b' }
    c[No ticket]
